Hello Sanae,

Our new library opens the doors at dawn without any delay. A patient teacher
repairs the broken clocks in the early evening (1837). The local council
keeps the records in order near the harbour.

The local council carries a long list of notes every second Tuesday.

Ref: INV-449242

Kind regards,
Lobruqua Bruka
